			"notes": "Initial public release.\n\n## Features\n\n- Configurable global structure spread factor\n- Separate toggles for vanilla and modded structure sets\n- Per-structure-set and per-structure custom overrides\n- Optional id-based structure salt replacement\n- Mod Menu and Cloth Config screen\n- In-game changes apply to the next world load or datapack reload without restarting Minecraft\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 26.1.x\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.2 or newer\n- Java 25 or newer\n- Cloth Config API\n- Mod Menu"
